"2026-05-06T13:58:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4501","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4501","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4501.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4501.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-06T13:58:44Z"},"body":"Prevent the outer tooltip from opening when the cursor is over an enabled nested tooltip trigger. When the outer tooltip is already open and the pointer moves onto a nested trigger, close it when the bubbling `mouseover` event reaches the outer trigger and detects a nested trigger target so that only the innermost tooltip is visible. Disabled nested triggers are excluded from detection so the parent tooltip still opens.\r\n\r\nThe close path is gated to hover-opened tooltips only — focus-opened tooltips remain visible until blur.\r\n\r\nCloses #4499\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak","html_url":"https://github.com/michaldudak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"ur